# 1.1: MIDI program change (Penumbra's idea). Programs 0-7, on any channel, are the eight pieces, as PRESET turned
# to them; the rest do nothing. The piece already playing: nothing (a DAW sends it at every clip's start)
wait 500
expect piece 0
expect playing 1
listen
midi C0 03 00
wait 300
expect piece 3
said PIECE
expect playing 1
# any channel
midi C9 01 00
wait 300
expect piece 1
said PIECE Burren
# 8 and above: nothing
midi C0 08 00
wait 300
expect piece 1
midi C0 7F 00
wait 300
expect piece 1
said_none PIECE
# the one playing: nothing, not grown again
midi C0 01 00
wait 300
expect piece 1
said_none PIECE
# channel 16, and the last piece
midi CF 07 00
wait 300
expect piece 7
said PIECE Tir na nOg
expect playing 1
